  "details": "It would be amazing if there was a setting for a 'preload threshold', maybe set to 150mb by default.\n\nThe idea being that, if a player runs to a portal and the world happens to be bigger than their threshold, say 700mb, it won't send them in, and would instead start preloading with a notification saying as much.\n\nInteracting again, or checking the notification could give them a 'go anyway' option.",
